        a: ['Mn = 55 000，Mw ≈ 91 800，Đ ≈ 1.67。按质量算，九成多的样品是长链，所以 Mw 更接近长链。', 'Mn = 55 000, Mw ≈ 91 800, Đ ≈ 1.67. By mass over nine-tenths of the sample is long chains, so Mw sits close to them.'],
